 *
 * Way of use : Open(nbitems); Add(..) : direct adding Add(..) AddSub (nsub) : for sub-counter Open (nbsubs) : nbsubs for this sub-counter Add (..) Close : the sub-counter `AddEnd()` etc... Close : the starting counter
