 * All the requirements of GFA for the DATA are inherited in this algorithm. The arguments could be of any type (dimension) and should be valid in terms of {@link BRepCheck_Analyzer | `BRepCheck_Analyzer`} and {@link BOPAlgo_ArgumentAnalyzer | `BOPAlgo_ArgumentAnalyzer`}.
